{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120100","id":3828070284,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7kK7eM","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120100","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120100.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120100.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120100","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120100/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120100/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120100/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1aac621efef4dcaaf5fbef07013a2b1f1fa33a45","number":120100,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve scene instantiation performance when attached `@tool` script has overridden `_get_property_list()`","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Addresses #97829 (decreases `@tool` and non-tool discrepancy from 1.6x->1.3x)\r\n- Optimizes a few low-hanging fruits in the `PackedScene::instantiate` code-path.\r\n  - Most are by reducing Variant-subtype copies and assignments.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI profiled the scene with properties from #97829 and targeted a few of the code-paths.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"451\" height=\"260\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56ad18cb-93e4-4579-b216-ad918b4b4bd2\" />\r\n\r\n'O' marks an optimization, while '*' marks that an optimization was added for one of the deeper branches.\r\n\r\nThe bulk of the performance improvements from this PR come from optimizations to `setup_resources_in_dictionary`.\r\n\r\nProfiling results with the PR changes:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"457\" height=\"282\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a13c52c-46d4-4833-8bda-0e7b554189d8\" />\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Testing cases</summary>\r\n\r\n### A\r\n\r\nThe scene with properties from #97829. N = 50,000\r\n\r\n### B\r\n\r\nScene with 100 member empty dictionaries all included in `_get_property_list`. N = 10,000\r\n\r\n### C\r\n\r\nScene with 100 member empty arrays all included in `_get_property_list`. N = 10,000\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nEach scenario is run 10 times and the 25th percentile is shown. Built on W11 MinGW.\r\n\r\n### Editor\r\n\r\n| Scenario | PR | Master | % diff |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| A (various types) | 0.562s | 0.667s | -16% |\r\n| B (Dictionary) | 0.340s | 0.489s | -30% |\r\n| C (Array) | 0.256s | 0.313s | -18% |\r\n\r\n### Release templates\r\n\r\n| Scenario | PR | Master | % diff |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| A (various types) | 0.387s | 0.480s | -19% |\r\n| B (Dictionary) | 0.252s | 0.371s | -32% |\r\n| C (Array) | 0.167s | 0.214s | -22% |\r\n\r\n\r\nTest project: [scene_property_list.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28734374/scene_property_list.zip)\r\n\r\n## Future Work\r\n\r\nThe duplication of Dictionaries and Arrays are responsible for a large share of the remaining difference. I am not sure if this is necessary. I think we should either deep duplicate or not at all - we currently shallow duplicate.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4Afb